# tooling); client-server & google-secure-signals server-side resolve 3.1.2 dev-only; no direct
# fast-uri import; sample-app build/dev tooling
# See: UID2-7633
CVE-2026-18446 exp:2026-11-06

# CVE-2026-69152 — brace-expansion (npm, transitive via minimatch) (HIGH).
